    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Angela Redmond",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101893290681950282361/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK3pco48sjJyoA6QmxOtdrVnM9zv1IDwziqjm5__2OlJyCLRg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "So furious with this company! I do not recommend them at all! Ordered two cartridges according to their website that would  fit my printer.  I get the toner cartridges and neither works! I emailed yhem and they want to send me a part yo remove a chip off my old yoner from HP! I advised them the chip is super glued in the HP toner. I  requested a return/refund and haven’t heard back! Terrible customer service! Buyers beware!",
        "time": 1768597276,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Corey Carlaw",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100551601019247712844/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJbZIJFjqtGZQERH0mnviyfImhFDNK8s6jiSJ-9kWtMKUuK1Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Excellent service and very good quality products. I had a concern with an order, Lindsay from customer support got it resolved immediately for me.  I keep coming back to this vendor for good reason.",
        "time": 1767796325,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kevin Zhu",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109134254715400547022/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXroQyDCJ6qOc4QPmitxxmPyctT-4tPtzO1SxNmpt4-L-05N4db=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "i bought the cocotte from shopper+, it is a very bad experience, they sent me a defective used product. I tried to talk to them, they told me it's not their business,and pls from shopper+ I paid for a free return which they denied about what i paid. they want me to contact staub directly, and it will be me who gonna pay the shipping for a return, so I never had this kind of bad service before, and i will never buy anything from shopper+",
        "time": 1767370167,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Liao Ena",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105959607525853369464/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKHPqMSluYsvDtnghiymED3ZMUeOMFVOtevpKpWdtG4PQAYQlDq=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "I bought a standing desk here two years ago. At the time, I was also considering a similar-looking model from Costco, but after comparing carefully, I realized both used motors from the same manufacturer. This one was much more affordable and had a sleeker, more stylish design. I’m really happy with my decision — the desk is sturdy, works smoothly, and still looks great after two years of daily use. Highly recommended!",
        "time": 1754333598,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ting Yan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113245854909618050369/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJNKqXFP9FZUa_F9nwp4Qe-WFReptpPx9iiiFNKP4IBXdG1gg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "This is a review for Antonia from Shopper Plus.\n\nTwo weeks ago I had called Shopper Plus to see if it sold just the detachable parts for a meat grinder I had bought from Walmart recently as I saw Shopper Plus also sells the same meat grinder. I had put the detachable parts in a dishwasher without thinking and it came out all grey. I didn't want to continue using it for my family in case it was detrimental for health but also didn't want to buy a new one if possible as I had only used it just once.\n\nAntonia took down all the information and told me she would get back to me after she speaks with the technician. Truthfully, at the time I wasn't sure if I was going to hear back and didn't have my hopes up, especially since the product came in a package (it's not often they sell parts) and I didn't even buy the meat grinder from Shopper Plus to start with.\n\nHowever, Antonia got back to me two more times to keep me updated and worked with me to get the information that the technician required. Several days after my initial call, she called again to tell me that they indeed sell just the detachable parts and that she had sent me an email with the link!\n\nFor someone that didn't even buy the original product from Shopper Plus, Antonia truly went above and beyond to help me out and I am extremely thankful.",
        "time": 1761249277,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
